-- src:5574 | 10. Power to transfer any proceedings to any other court or to or from any
-- src:5575 | subordinate court, and in the case of transfer to or from a subordinate court to give
-- src:5576 | any directions as to the further conduct thereof, except that this power is to be
-- src:5577 | exercised in such manner as may be prescribed by Rules of Court or Family
-- src:5578 | Justice Rules.
@ref First Schedule para 10 (src:5572-5578)
GIVEN court IS A Court
