GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 para 10 the court may transfer the proceedings` MEANS
    `sch 1 the power is the General Division's` court
        (IF `the transfer is to any other court, or to or from a subordinate court`
         THEN JUST TRUE
         -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is to transfer "to any other court or to or from any subordinate court", and the paragraph says nothing of any other transfer
         ELSE NOTHING)

-- src:5580 | Set-off
-- src:5581 | 11. Power to allow a defence of set-off.
@ref First Schedule para 11 (src:5580-5581)
GIVEN court IS A Court
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`sch 1 para 11 the court may allow a defence of set-off` MEANS
